stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> IMPORTED: O1 cutover import loaded, section 16
    IMPORTED --> RECONCILED: O2 tie-out passes on every V-15 head at zero rupees
    IMPORTED --> DISPUTED: O3 a head differs from its independent record
    DISPUTED --> IMPORTED: O4 corrected import loaded
    RECONCILED --> ATTESTED: O5 the employer's named signer attests the set
    ATTESTED --> IN_USE: O6 the first live run reads it
    IN_USE --> SUPERSEDED: O7 a later attested correction replaces it
    SUPERSEDED --> IN_USE: O8 the correction is itself attested and in use
    DISPUTED --> [*]: O9 go-live refused for the employee

    note right of IMPORTED
      Not an evaluation input yet.
      No run may read a set
      short of ATTESTED.
    end note

    note right of ATTESTED
      Carries the attesting person,
      the date, the source system and
      the evidence reference. It carries
      no rule version - these figures
      were never computed here.
    end note

    note right of IN_USE
      Read by the TDS projection step 1,
      the Article 276 running cap, the
      ESI contribution-period state, the
      lifetime exemption balances and the
      year-end record. Replay returns the
      attested value, never a recomputation.
    end note

    note right of SUPERSEDED
      Both sets stay resolvable.
      Runs already locked keep the set
      they read - a correction reaches
      them only as a correction run.
    end note
